## =========================================
## DEV-PC DNS OVERRIDE
## =========================================
# Used by services with `dns: ["${DNS1:-}", "${DNS2:-}"]` directives
# (currently: searxng, metube). Leave UNSET on the Pi — Docker falls back
# to the host's resolv.conf (AdGuard at 192.168.0.2) and that works fine.
# SET BOTH when testing on a dev PC without LAN AdGuard reachability.
# Recommended PC values (Cloudflare + Cloudflare malware-blocking):
DNS1=
DNS2=
